        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">
          Civil Service Acronym Buster
          <span class="govuk-caption-m">Like Ghost Busters ... except for CS Acronyms!</span>
        </h1>

        <p>The Civil Service as an organisation, runs on Acronyms. Anyone
  new to a Department or area of work might think that their colleagues
  are speaking a different language.</p>
        <p>This site attempts to document all the acronyms used in order to improve everyone's understanding in the workplace.</p>

        <div class="govuk-inset-text">
    Acronym not here? Contribute to the <a class="govuk-link" target="_blank" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S_plW5LSGM8JT4lvjLMw40nFeGgN3xOWEefVA8Y4xcc/edit?usp=sharing">list</a>, someone else might know the answer or meaning.
  </div>

      </div>
